      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Being able to schedule a group event in the future is badly needed.  Creating an event should include setting a start and end date and time, instance setup for the event which will be auto-instantiated at the start time and persist until the end time (or optionally later if the instance is still populated), and pre-written scheduled announcements about the event.",
